  <p>A drawn or typed signature placed by HatePDF is a visual mark, not a certificate-backed digital signature, identity verification, timestamp, or legal opinion. Redaction, metadata removal, OCR, PDF/A conversion, repair, and accessibility results must be inspected before the original is deleted or the output is filed, published, or produced in a legal matter.</p>

